Changes:
 niaos-root-preparation (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium
 .
   * Add an internal controller primitive for dedicated ext4 bank write exclusion.
   * Preserve read-only storage after handle close and all late failures.
   * Hold the exclusive bank reservation using a read-only descriptor.
